{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3vX7h9E3P42EBFP2rp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, its grain weathered by countless seasons. A single iron keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the chamber.*\n\n*The door swings inward slowly, hinges groaning with the weight of ages. Beyond its threshold: a corridor of pale golden light, warm air carrying the scent of old stone and distant rain. Dust motes spiral lazily in the glow.*\n\n*The way is open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":116,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}